Genus scripts. Usage and conventions: see ../README.md.

  genus.tcl                   main flow: read RTL -> elaborate -> synthesize -> export -> reports
  run_sweep.tcl               clock-period (Fmax) sweep, then a full-effort run at the last passing period
  report_power.tcl            vectorless power on an already-synthesized design
  report_power_activity.tcl   VCD-driven power on an already-synthesized design
  procedures.tcl              shared helper procs (enics_*)

  settings.tcl, simulation.tcl   not used by the flow (OCV settings, gate-level VCD probing)
